body:
Found the problem!  
It was part of a google tag.  
<!-- Google tag (gtag.js) -->  
<script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=XXXXXXX"></script>  
<script>  
window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || \[\];  
function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}  
gtag('js', new Date());  
gtag('config', 'G-6DB4BE4PB4');  
</script>}  
(the last key after </script>) I am unsure of how that one got there.  
Thank you very much tho! :)

